<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh June forex reserves rise to $1.72 bln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh June forex reserves rise to $1.72 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange reserves rose to $1.72 billion at the end of June from $1.6 billion in May, central bank officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The reserves were $2.02 billion in June, 1996.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves (month):</p>
<p>(in billion dollar)</p>
<p>    June	     May	     June 96</p>
<p>    $1.72	    $1.6	    $2.02</p>
</text>
